# Used by Node-side tooling only (drizzle-kit migrations, scripts/import-sqlite.ts).
# The app's own settings live in wrangler.jsonc (vars), `wrangler secret put` (secrets),
# and .dev.vars for local development (see .dev.vars.example).
#
# Supabase: Project Settings → Database → Connection string. Use the *Session pooler*
# string from machines without IPv6 (e.g. GitHub Actions); the direct string is what
# Hyperdrive should use.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:password@localhost:5432/kanban
